15 0 obj
<< /A 42 0 R /Alt (Illustration showing a three-stage pathway\204Initiation, Amplification, Execution\204depicting immune and metabolic responses in trophoblasts, leading to TNF-alpha storm, pyroptosis, placental dysfunction, and increased miscarriage risk. Text labels summarize signaling, cell types, and outcomes.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 30 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
16 0 obj
<< /A 43 0 R /Alt (Infographic illustrating normally glycosylated beta-hCG interacting with Treg cells, decidual macrophages, uterine NK cells, and vascular endothelial cells, triggering pathways that promote immune tolerance and angiogenesis for successful immune tolerance maintenance in pregnancy.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 31 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
