19 0 obj
<< /A 46 0 R /Alt (Diagram illustrates the metabolic and immunological differences between Treg cells, associated with stable immune tolerance and lower oxidative phosphorylation and fatty acid oxidation, and Th17 cells, linked to metabolic reprogramming, increased glycolysis, lactate production, and TNF-alpha signaling, with polarization shift shown between these T cell states.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 34 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
20 0 obj
<< /A 47 0 R /Alt (Diagram illustrating pathways of trophoblast cell pyroptosis, showing caspase-dependent and caspase-independent mechanisms triggered by stressed trophoblast DAMPs, elevated lactate, calcium influx, and activation of calpain, caspase-1, inflammasome, and GSDMD resulting in cell death.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 35 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
